.TH VIDSCRIBE 1 "2026-10-12" "vidscribe 0.1"
.SH NAME
vidscribe \- video URL or media file to timed transcript
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B vidscribe
.IR URL | FILE ...
.RB [ \-f
.IR formats ]
.RB [ \-m
.IR model ]
.RB [ \-l
.IR lang ]
.RB [ \-o
.IR dir ]
.RB [ \-c
.IR browser ]
.RB [ \-\-json\-full ]
.RB [ \-\-keep\-video ]
.RB [ \-\-cpu ]
.RB [ \-V ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Turns the speech in a video into a timed transcript. Give it a video link
(Instagram, YouTube and most other video sites) or a local audio/video file
and it writes the spoken text with timestamps as txt, srt, vtt or json into
the output directory. The written file names are printed to stdout.
.PP
Several sources can be given in one call. A source that fails is reported and
skipped; the others are still processed and the exit status is non\-zero.
An existing transcript is never overwritten: the next one with the same title
becomes \fItitle\-2\fR, \fItitle\-3\fR, and so on.
.PP
Built on yt\-dlp and whisper.cpp.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI \-f " formats"
Comma separated list of txt, srt, vtt, json. Default: all four.
srt, vtt and json carry timestamps.
.TP
.BI \-m " model"
whisper.cpp model name, e.g. small, medium, large\-v3\-turbo. Default: small.
.TP
.BI \-l " lang"
Spoken language (de, en, ...) or auto. Default: auto.
.TP
.BI \-o " dir"
Output directory, created if missing. Default: current directory.
.TP
.BI \-c " browser"
Pass cookies from this browser to yt\-dlp, e.g. firefox. Needed for
login\-walled Instagram reels.
.TP
.B \-\-json\-full
JSON output including per\-token timing.
.TP
.B \-\-keep\-video
Also save the downloaded media file, merged into one file (URL input only).
.TP
.B \-\-cpu
Do not use the GPU.
.TP
.B \-V, \-\-version
Print the version and exit.
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
Show usage.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/vidscribe/ggml\-MODEL.bin
Model cache. Downloaded from huggingface.co/ggerganov/whisper.cpp on first use
(small is about 470 MB) and verified against the published SHA\-256.
Honors XDG_DATA_HOME.
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
vidscribe https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ID \-l en \-f srt
vidscribe https://www.instagram.com/reel/ID/ \-c firefox \-o ~/transcripts
vidscribe talk.mp4 \-m large\-v3\-turbo
vidscribe a.mp4 b.mp4 \-f txt \-\-cpu
.fi
.SH EXIT STATUS
0 if every source was transcribed, 1 otherwise.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR yt\-dlp (1),
.BR ffmpeg (1)
